id: search
name: Search
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: true
special: true
usageLimit: 1/round
clashSkill: perception
clashDefenderSkills: stealth
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Clash of your Perception against the Stealth of an Opponent Hidden from you: win, and you are no longer Oblivious of
  them.
text: >
  Search Maneuver [1/Round]: Look for a hidden opponent!
  –Maneuver Type: Standard Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: Free
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Exploitable: N/A
  –Effect: Target an Opponent that is Hidden from you. Make a Skill Clash (Perception vs Stealth) against them. If you
  win, you are no longer Oblivious of them.

---

# Opened by 2+ Ranks in Perception (the user's ruling). The one Maneuver that may target someone Hidden from you - and
# only such a one (use-maneuver.mjs). Won, they are no longer Hidden from you (module/hidden.mjs).
